WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.902
Here's what you'll be able to
do by the end of this module,

2
00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:04.912
which takes about an hour with the lab.

3
00:00:04.912 --> 00:00:08.211
You'll explain what Gate 1
records about each product's

4
00:00:08.211 --> 00:00:11.949
authorization and each action
that runs from a vendor's cloud.

5
00:00:11.949 --> 00:00:16.612
You'll describe the ServiceNow roles the
kit uses and why they're split by task.

6
00:00:16.612 --> 00:00:21.050
You'll describe the SailPoint scopes
and Graph permissions each task needs,

7
00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:23.938
and why the workflow scope
gets a client of its own.

8
00:00:23.938 --> 00:00:27.026
And you'll verify a grant
against the kit's call list,

9
00:00:27.026 --> 00:00:28.938
and catch a grant that's too wide.

10
00:00:28.938 --> 00:00:30.688
You need Module 1 first.

11
00:00:30.688 --> 00:00:36.038
For the Graph rows, the Microsoft Automation
path's first module covers permissions.

12
00:00:36.038 --> 00:00:41.950
Lab 1 runs on fixtures; Lab 2 needs a
developer instance and a sandbox tenant.
